OL,3,GNEWSAStar praises 'intimate' feel of
OL,4,Apanto theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedian and actor Richard Blackwood
OL,7,Fhas signed up as pirate captain Long
OL,8,FJohn Silver for a pantomime version of
OL,9,FTreasure Island this Christmas.
OL,11,FThe production is scheduled to run from
OL,12,F28 November 2026 until 3 January at
OL,13,FWolverhampton Grand Theatre.
OL,15,FIt follows last year's rendition of
OL,16,FSleeping Beauty which won Best Panto In
OL,17,FThe UK (over 950 seats) at the UK
OL,18,FPantomime Awards.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
